In mammal-richness.csv, we include polyfid and the total number of mammal species as reported in IUCN 2025.

In mammal-richness_Rodentia_Eulipotyphla.csv, we include polyfid and the total number of just rodent and eulipotyphla species as reported in IUCN 2025, 

In breeding-bird-richness-raptors, we include the polyfid id and the total number of Accipitriformes, Falconiformes, and Strigiformes from BirdLife International 2022.


